    <span class="b1">)</span>
    = 0.619
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   <span class="eq">
    <var>α</var>
    =
    <var>α</var>
    <sub>n</sub>
    ·
    <var>α</var>
    <sub>s</sub>
    = 0.817 · 0.619 = 0.506
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   <b>Analysis results</b>
  </p>
  <p>
   Fundamental period of first vibration mode -
