    <var>T</var>
    <sub>C</sub>
    = 0.6
    <i>s</i>
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Basic behavior factor value -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>q</var>
    <sub>0</sub>
    = 3.9
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
