    <span class="dvc">
     0.6
     <i>s</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     0.55
     <i>s</i>
    </span>
    = 7.33
   </span>
   - for T
   <sub>1</sub>
   &lt; T
   <sub>C</sub>
  </p>
  <!-- <span class="eq"><var>μ</var><sub>Φ</sub> = 1.5 · <var>μ</var><sub>Φ</sub> = 1.5 · 7.33 = 10.99</span> -->
  <p class="ref">[§ 5.2.3.4 (4)]</p>
  <p>
   For steel class B, ductility factor is increased by 05% -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>μ</var>
    <sub>Φ</sub>
    = 10.99
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Design value of steel yield strain -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>ε</var>
    <sub>sy_d</sub>
    =
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>f</var>
     <sub>yd</sub>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>E</var>
     <sub>s</sub>
    </span>
    =
    <span class="dvc">
     434.78
     <i>MPa</i>
     <span class="dvl">
